return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'WordPress.com - Big Sky','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-16T17:25:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-09 14:59:00+0000','x-generator'=>'GlotPress/2.4.0-alpha','messages'=>['Here is the visible area of the canvas. Photographs are shown as flat placeholder boxes at their real size, so treat any grey rectangle as an image that is present, not as a missing one.'=>'這是畫布的可見區域。 相片會以實際大小的平面預留位置方塊顯示，因此會將任何灰色矩形視為已存在的圖片，而非遺漏的圖片。','Here is the canvas around %d block(s). Photographs are shown as flat placeholder boxes at their real size, so treat any grey rectangle as an image that is present, not as a missing one.'=>'這是 %d 區塊周圍的畫布。 相片會以實際大小的平面預留位置方塊顯示，因此會將任何灰色矩形視為已存在的圖片，而非遺漏的圖片。','Here is the whole page, top to bottom. It is scaled down to fit, so body text will not be legible — read it for colour, type scale, spacing and section rhythm, and take an ordinary picture of a specific area when wording or fine detail matters. Photographs are shown as flat placeholder boxes at their real size.'=>'這是從上到下的整個頁面。 頁面已縮小以符合版面，因此內文文字無法辨識；請觀察顏色、字體大小、間距和區段編排，並在需要文字或細節資訊時，拍攝一張特定區域的普通圖片。 相片會以實際大小的平面預留位置方塊顯示。','I couldn\'t get a picture of the canvas just now.'=>'我剛才無法拍到畫布的圖片。','Takes a picture of the editor canvas as it currently renders, including unsaved changes. Use it to check how the page actually looks when the block data alone cannot answer that — after changing styles, colours, spacing or CSS, or whenever a reported problem is visual. Pass fullPage to see the whole page at once, which is what a theme or global styles change needs checking against. Photographs are replaced by flat placeholder boxes at their real size.'=>'拍攝編輯器畫布目前呈現的圖片，包括未儲存的變更。 在變更樣式、顏色、間距或 CSS 後，或當回報的問題涉及視覺呈現時，當僅憑區塊資料無法得知頁面實際外觀時藉此進行確認。 傳遞 fullPage 即可一次檢視整個頁面，這正是佈景主題或全域樣式變更需要進行比對的依據。 相片會由實際大小的平面預留位置方塊所取代。','Capture Canvas'=>'擷取畫布','Are there any changes you would like me to make?'=>'有任何你想要我進行的變更嗎？','Your site is ready! Please click around and check it out.'=>'你的網站已就緒！ 請隨意點選瀏覽。','Switching to edit mode so you can watch the new design being built.'=>'切換到編輯模式，以便觀看建置中的新設計。','Return to WP Admin'=>'返回 WP 管理員','Personalize my site copy with my details.'=>'使用我的詳細資料，將我的網站複本個人化。','Your changes could not be saved. Your work is still here — try saving again.'=>'無法儲存你的變更。 你的作品還在這裡，請再儲存一次。','Some changes could not be saved. Your work is still here — try saving again.'=>'無法儲存部分變更。 你的作品還在這裡，請再儲存一次。','Save your changes?'=>'確定要儲存變更？','You need to save or discard the changes to the current page.'=>'請儲存或捨棄目前頁面的變更。','The preview shows your saved site, so unsaved changes won’t appear there.'=>'預覽畫面會顯示已儲存的網站內容，因此未儲存的變更不會顯示於此處。','Save draft'=>'儲存草稿','Publish'=>'發佈','Redo'=>'取消復原','Open in a new tab'=>'在新分頁中開啟','Mode'=>'模式','Responsive view: %s'=>'回應式檢視：%s','Responsive view'=>'回應式檢視','Reload preview'=>'重新載入預覽','Annotate'=>'加上註解','Resume annotating, %d pending'=>'繼續註解，有 %d 筆待確認','Chat is unavailable'=>'無法對談','Mobile'=>'行動','Tablet'=>'平板電腦','Desktop'=>'桌上型電腦','Preview'=>'預覽','The site preview could not be loaded.'=>'無法載入網站預覽。','(no title)'=>'(無標題)','%s — Draft'=>'%s (草稿)','Switch page. Current page: %s'=>'切換頁面。 目前頁面：%s','Switch page'=>'切換頁面','Switching to edit mode so you can see the changes.'=>'切換到編輯模式，以便檢視變更。','Switching to edit mode so you can approve the changes before saving.'=>'切換到編輯模式，方便你在儲存前先核准變更。','Annotations could not be sent — the assistant is unavailable.'=>'無法傳送註解，助理無法使用。','%d annotation submitted'=>'%d 個已提交的註解','Annotating'=>'正在註解','Discard annotations'=>'捨棄註解','Exit annotation mode'=>'結束註解模式','Send %d annotation'=>'傳送 %d 筆註解','Sending…'=>'正在傳送...','Send'=>'傳送','Save annotation'=>'儲存註解','Update annotation'=>'更新註解','Delete annotation'=>'刪除註解','Add a comment…'=>'新增留言...','Annotate %s'=>'為「%s」加上註解','Annotate blocks. Use the arrow keys to move between blocks, Enter to comment, and Escape to exit.'=>'為區塊加上註解。 使用方向鍵在不同區塊之間移動，按 Enter 鍵留言，按 Esc 鍵結束。','Annotation %1$d: %2$s'=>'註解 %1$d：%2$s','%1$s, block %2$d of %3$d'=>'%1$s，區塊 %2$d/%3$d','Navigation items not found: %s. These are not in the menu or in the current page structure, so there is nothing to reorder them from — they are most likely from an earlier turn, or the header is not part of the page currently open in the editor. Read the page structure again and use the clientIds it returns, or identify each item by its url or label instead. This reorder was not applied.'=>'找不到導覽列項目：%s。 這些項目不在選單或目前的頁面結構中，因此沒有重新排序的依據，很可能是從較早的頁首開始排序，或是頁首不屬於目前於編輯器中開啟的頁面。 請再次閱讀頁面結構並使用其回傳的 clientId，或是改成根據其 URL 或標籤來識別各個項目。 未套用這項重新排序。','Your WordPress.com AI agent that helps with site setup, content, design, and more.'=>'你的 WordPress.com AI 代理程式，可協助網站設定、內容、設計等。','WordPress Agent'=>'WordPress 代理程式','Invalid editor path. look up the numeric id from <site_pages>, then retry navigation with the numeric editor_path.'=>'無效的編輯器路徑。請從「<site_pages>」查詢數值 ID，然後使用數值 editor_path 重新嘗試導覽。','Invalid editor path. Page navigation requires /page/{numeric-id}. Look up the page ID first.'=>'無效的編輯器路徑。 頁面導覽需要 /page/{numeric-id}。 請先查詢頁面 ID。','Saves everything and navigates to the specified path in the editor. For page navigation, path must be a numeric editor path like "/page/123" or "page/123"; full URLs, slugs, "all-pages", and paths like "/visit" or "/page/visit" are invalid. If the user names a page and the current page is not the target, look up the numeric id from <site_pages> first, then navigate with the numeric editor path.'=>'儲存所有內容，然後前往編輯器中的指定路徑。 若為頁面導覽，路徑必須是數值編輯器路徑，例如「/page/123」或「page/123」，至於完整 URL、代稱、「all-pages」以及「/visit」或「/page/visit」等路徑則皆無效。 如果使用者為頁面命名，而目前的頁面並非目標，請先從 <site_pages> 查詢數值 ID，然後使用數值編輯器路徑加以導覽。','I did not restore that checkpoint because it may replace or remove too much current content.'=>'我沒有還原檢查點，因為檢查點可能會取代或移除太多目前的內容。','Restores editor state from a checkpoint associated with a previous mutating tool call. Use for undo/redo requests. Prefer checkpointId values from clientContext.availableCheckpoints whose toolId matches the user intent: block-edit checkpoints for content changes, theme-update checkpoints for style/theme changes, and navigation/entity checkpoints for navigation/entity changes. For undo, use the checkpointId for the most recent relevant non-restore mutating Big Sky tool call. Only use a checkpoint whose toolId is big_sky__restore_checkpoint for explicit redo requests, because those checkpoints represent the state before a prior undo/restore. Pass requestIntentType to describe the user intent: "undo" for undo requests, "redo" for redo requests, or "restore" when restoring a specific checkpoint/version. The checkpoint ID usually starts with "toolu_". Do not use the current restore-checkpoint call ID, any id starting with "call_", a tool name/id, or calypsoCheckpointId/messageId. If the user reports missing homepage/footer/navigation content, do not rebuild or redesign unless the user explicitly agrees; try a relevant checkpoint, WordPress revisions, or support escalation instead.'=>'從與前一個變動性工具呼叫相關聯的檢查點，還原編輯器狀態。 用於復原/重做要求。 偏好使用 clientContext.availableCheckpoints 的 checkpointId 值，其 toolId 與使用者意圖相符：內容變更的 block-edit 檢查點、樣式/佈景主題變更的 theme-update 檢查點，以及導覽/實體變更的 navigation/entity 檢查點。 若要執行復原，請使用最近一個相關且非還原的變動性 Big Sky 工具呼叫的 checkpointId。 對於明確的重做要求，請只使用 toolId 為 big_sky__restore_checkpoint 的檢查點，因為這些檢查點代表先前復原/還原之前的狀態。 傳送 requestIntentType 來說明使用者意圖：復原要求的「復原」、重做要求的「重做」，或回復特定檢查點/版本時的「回復」。 檢查點 ID 通常以「toolu_」開頭。 請勿使用目前的還原檢查點呼叫 ID、以「call_」開頭的任何 ID、工具名稱/id 或 calypsoCheckpointId/messageId。 如果使用者回報缺少首頁/頁尾/導覽內容，除非使用者明確同意，否則請勿重新建置或重新設計。不妨改試相關的檢查點、WordPress 修訂版本，或向上通報支援。','The editor is still loading. Try the page design again once the page is editable.'=>'編輯器仍在載入中。 請在可編輯頁面時，重新嘗試頁面設計。','The generated page content has been staged in the editor for review.'=>'生成的頁面內容放入編輯器暫存區，供你審核。','Stream Page Design'=>'串流頁面設計','The requested changes were already applied.'=>'要求的變更已套用。','Open Help Center'=>'開啟說明中心','Get help'=>'輔助說明','Show the user a button they can click to open WordPress.com Help Center chat when t