ange the %s button link to:'=>'將 %s 按鈕連結變更為：','Create a new page on my site for'=>'針對以下項目在我的網站建立新頁面：','Add new page'=>'新建頁面','Show me different layouts for this page'=>'顯示此頁面的不同版面配置','Change page layout'=>'變更頁面版面配置','Show me color palettes for my site that are:'=>'顯示網站的調色盤，這些調色盤為：','Customize colors'=>'自訂顏色','Show me new fonts for my site'=>'顯示網站的新字型','Choose new fonts'=>'選擇新字型','AI-powered site building and navigation abilities.'=>'AI 網站建置和導覽功能。','Edit'=>'編輯','Pop out sidebar'=>'彈出側邊欄','Move to sidebar'=>'移至側邊欄','Got a different request? Ask away.'=>'有其他要求嗎？ 直接詢問。','Howdy! How can I help you today?'=>'你好！ 今天可以為你提供哪些協助？','Updated:'=>'更新：','Theme updated successfully'=>'佈景主題已成功更新。','Invalid styles format. Styles must be an object.'=>'樣式格式無效。 樣式必須為物件。','Invalid settings format. Settings must be an object.'=>'設定格式無效。 設定必須為物件。','Invalid arguments. Provide either settings or styles to update the theme.'=>'引數無效。 提供設定或樣式以更新佈景主題。','AI Editor'=>'AI 編輯器','Proceed'=>'繼續','Edit link'=>'編輯連結','There was an error with this request. Please try again.'=>'處理此要求時發生錯誤。 請再試一次。','No response from assistant'=>'助理沒有回應','Assistant completed successfully'=>'助理已成功完成','Something went wrong. Please try again.'=>'發生錯誤。請再試一次。','I have completed the edits.'=>'已完成編輯。','The current theme (%s) is a block theme.'=>'目前的佈景主題 (%s) 為區塊佈景主題。','The current theme is not a block theme. Big Sky requires a block theme to be active.'=>'目前的佈景主題並非區塊佈景主題。 請先啟用區塊佈景主題，才能使用 Big Sky。','Sorry, I\'ve encountered an error. Please try again or let me know if you need help with something else.'=>'抱歉，系統發生錯誤。 請再試一次，或在需要其他協助時通知我。','I changed my mind'=>'我改變心意了','I was not able to make the changes you requested. Either I don\'t have the capability to do so or I didn\'t understand your request. You can ask me to try again or ask me to do something else.'=>'我無法進行你所要求的變更。 可能是因為我沒有能力執行，也可能是我不了解你的要求。 你可以要求我再試一次，或要求我進行其他動作。','Site preview'=>'網站預覽','Generate image'=>'產生圖片','Pages'=>'頁面','Home'=>'主頁','No'=>'不','Yes'=>'是','Add Pages'=>'